														WHAT YOU NEED<br />
1. You should be between levels 40 and 52. Clerics as low as 39 (with complete heal) are also useful.<br />
2. An unbuffed Magic Resistance of 50 and a Fire Resistance of 50. The higher the better.<br />
3. Bring two peridots: one for cleric and one for enchanter. These will be used for beneficial spells. <br />
<br />
HOW TO GET THERE<br />
1. Closest Druid portal: Lavastorm<br />
2. Closest Wizard portal: SE corner of Nekulos Forest<br />
<br />
IMPORTANT THINGS TO REMEMBER<br />
1. Naggy is a level 55 Dragon Warrior.<br />
2. Naggy's most deadly weapon is his AE fire breath and AE fear spell. Wear as much MR/FR gear as possible; sacrifice all other statistics (yes, even AC) to get these as high as possible.<br />
3. Check your resist gear. If you don't have much, consider acquiring: 2xEarring of Fire Reflection (AC1 FR5 ~26pp at Lavastorm gypsies), Gold Diamond Mask (FR10 CR10 MR3), Gold Hermatite Necklace (FR7), Gold Emerald Bracelet (AC4 FR6), Platinum Emerald Ring (AC4 FR10), Hand Woven Legging (AC8 FR10), Rune Boned Fork (MR10 CR10 FR10), and Crown of the Froglok King (AC12 CR20 FR20).<br />
4. Many of the mobs in Solusek have high fire resist - including Nag, use cold based spells where possible for minimum resists.<br />
5. In order to cast any spell on a dragon - YOU MUST BE WITHIN HIS MELEE RANGE.<br />
<br />
THE LOOT<br />
Ah, dragon loot. What tank doesn't want haste? Who wouldn't want a 100% weight reduction 10-slot bag that holds XL items? Or listen to cheers as a warrior, paladin, or a bard gets a critical item in their epic quest?<br />
1. Book of Scale - Paladin Fiery Avenger Epic<br />
2. Bladestopper - AC25 STA+15 HP+50 // 10 CHARGES RUNE IV // BRD CLR PAL RNG ROG SHD SHM WAR // ALL // 7.3WT<br />
3. Blight, Hammer of Scourge - 2HB STA+9 WIS+9 INT+9 DR+9 // 10 CHARGES SCOURGE // SHM // ALL // 10.0WT<br />
4. Cloak of Flames - AC10 AGI+9 DEX+9 FR+15 HP+50 // 35% HASTE // MELEE // ALL<br />
5. Gauntlet of Firey Might - AC10 STR+7 STA+7 DEX+7 PR+7 DR+7 // MELEE // ALL // 0.3WT<br />
6. Gold Plated Koshigatana - PRC 9/25 // DISMISS SUMMONED // MELEE // ALL // 2.5WT<br />
7. Heirophant's Crook - 2HB STR+9 DEX+9 WIS+9 // EARTHQUAKE // DRU // ALL // 7.5WT<br />
8. Orb of Tishan - 1HB 7/25 STR+9 STA+9 MANA+35 // TASHANIA // BRD ENC MAG NEC WIZ // ALL // 1.5WT <br />
9. Prayers of Life - 5 CHARGES WORD OF HEALING // ALL // ALL<br />
10. Red Dragon Scale - Bard &amp; Warrior Epic<br />
